# 13.0: an installation's `config/` also holds credentials, keys, the OAuth
# database and backups.  Nothing in any image needs them, and a build context
# is whatever checkout the operator happens to be standing in, so they are
# excluded here as well as named file-by-file in the Dockerfile COPY lines.
